#MOBILE
Vnum       202
Keywords   food drink clerk droid robot~
Short      a food-and-drink clerk droid~
Long       A food-service droid works the arrivals market checkout.
~
Desc       A clean service droid manages the chilled displays and hot-food counter for passengers moving through the terminal.
~
