#ROOM
Vnum     200
Name     &COrbital Transfer Shuttle &w:: &zDen Haag Arrivals~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors~
Desc     Crash-rated seats line both sides of a narrow transfer-shuttle aisle.
Overhead handrails and recessed lockers secure baggage during orbital hops.
Sealed viewports frame docking lights and traffic around the terminal.
Aft pressure doors connect the cabin with the active docking collar.
Status panels above the hatch track berth and approach information.
~
#ENDROOM
#ROOM
Vnum     201
Name     &CInterstellar Arrival Berth &w:: &zDen Haag Arrivals~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     Heavy safety rails surround a reinforced interstellar arrival berth.
Docking arms lock passenger craft against a sealed terminal collar.
Floor markings divide boarding space from baggage and service lanes.
Overhead indicators display pressure, berth and customs information.
The passenger route continues north into the docking causeway.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    202
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 209 1 201
Reset O 0 221 2 201
#ENDROOM
#ROOM
Vnum     202
Name     &CInterstellar Docking Causeway &w:: &zDen Haag Arrivals~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     A glazed docking causeway slopes gently into the terminal interior.
Structural ribs divide long windows overlooking the service apron.
Blue guide strips separate arriving passengers from returning crews.
Directional signs mark customs, connections and emergency routes.
The passage links the transfer lounge north with the berth south.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    203
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    201
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 208 1 202
#ENDROOM
#ROOM
