Name     &CInterstellar Transfer Lounge &w:: &zDen Haag Arrivals~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     Fixed seating lines a compact lounge beside the docking causeway.
Arrival boards display berth numbers, transfer times and customs notices.
Charging points and baggage spaces sit beneath the seating banks.
Acoustic panels reduce engine noise from the adjoining dock structure.
Routes continue north to the main causeway and south to the berth.
~
